  "notes": "改善应用在前台时对连接异常的检测。\n\n- 更及时地发现本地连接核心无响应的情况，Wi-Fi 和移动网络使用相同的本地检查频率。\n- 系统代理检查耗时较长时，不再拖慢连接核心的存活检测。\n- 恢复连接时，等待已有的系统代理操作完成，避免相互覆盖。\n- 保持原有的后台检查频率，清除连接状态前继续核实实际流量情况。\n",
  "notesEn": "Improve connection failure detection while the app is in the foreground.\n\n- Detect an unresponsive local connection core sooner, with the same local check frequency on Wi-Fi and cellular networks.\n- Keep slow system proxy checks from delaying core liveness detection.\n- Wait for an existing system proxy operation to finish before recovery replaces its settings.\n- Keep the existing background check frequency and verify actual traffic before clearing the connection state.\n",
